{"title": "Aura of Hate (Condition)", "pageid": 40946, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Aura_of_Hate_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Hate Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Aura of Hate</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Gains a bonus to melee weapon damage equal to the <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">charisma modifier</a> of the creature emanating the aura. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">AURA_OF_HATE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CAURA_OF_HATE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CAURA_OF_HATE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 5\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The effect does not apply to unarmed attacks such as with claws.</li>\n<li>The effect really applies to all nearby fiends and undead, including enemies.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Aura_of_Hate\">Sources of Aura of Hate</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Hate (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Hate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Hate (Aura) (Condition)\">Aura of Hate</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>AURA_OF_HATE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Aura_of_Hate\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Hate (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Hate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Hate (Aura) (Condition)\">Aura of Hate</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature and <b>all</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Fiends\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fiends\">fiends</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> within 3 m (10 ft) gain this creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">charisma modifier</a> as a bonus to their melee weapon damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Aura_of_Hate\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Hate (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Hate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Aura_of_Hate_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Aura of Hate</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Gains a bonus to melee weapon damage equal to the <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">charisma modifier</a> of the creature emanating the aura.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Gains a bonus to melee weapon damage equal to the <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">charisma modifier</a> of the creature emanating the aura.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202651\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2234/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29887/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7536/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.038/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1271294/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.326      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   63.326      1 -total\n 50.89%   32.225      3 Template:Hidden_code\n 30.66%   19.415      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 21.76%   13.779      7 Template:Icon_link\n 20.61%   13.053      7 Template:Icon_text\n 17.93%   11.356      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 17.59%   11.139     23 Template:Trim\n 16.91%   10.706      1 Template:MdCond\n 12.87%    8.147      3 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40946-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202651 and revision id 356110. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}